@bojana 
The phasing sensor is what controls that timing. If the phasing sensor is not registering correctly, it will not align the product with the teeth. The teeth are in fixed positions on the chain and can't be adjusted. 
 
I also can confirm that we do not need to make adjustments to any setpoints. It's not happening with every bar, which means the chocolates are getting hung up on buildup or the sensor is not registering all of them correctly
